22:20.205 --> 22:23.311
What?

22:34.519 --> 22:40.299
<i>If it's a never-ending road...</i>

22:41.026 --> 22:47.375
<i>...then I can see you again someday.</i>

22:47.466 --> 22:53.212
<i>You're a weakling who tries
to hide things with your kindness.</i>

22:53.839 --> 23:00.449
<i>I'm sorry for making you look that way.</i>

23:01.947 --> 23:08.057
<i>Looking for the truth...
I was searching for...</i>

23:08.653 --> 23:15.263
<i>...the blue sky since that time.</i>

23:16.661 --> 23:22.873
<i>Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.</i>

23:23.101 --> 23:29.541
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:29.674 --> 23:35.647
<i>Your smiley face is about to cry...
I promise to turn ii into something bright.</i>

23:36.114 --> 23:43.123
<i>Don't lei go of this hand.</i>

23:45.824 --> 23:50.068
<i>Our future is just around the corner.</i>

23:56.735 --> 24:00.615
Feelings that never reach you, should
never reach you, and that never go away.

24:00.705 --> 24:02.912
They all get mixed up.

24:03.375 --> 24:05.821
Next time on Kashimashi
- Girl Meets Girl~.

24:05.911 --> 24:08.255
Hazumu's Heart, Yasuna's Heart.

24:08.346 --> 24:10.622
These feelings... in my heart.
